WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
The rain had been falling for three days.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Every street in the city shimmered like liquid glass.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
At the edge of town. a boy named Arin found an old key.

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
It was cold. silver. and engraved with strange symbols.

5
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
No one in the village knew where it came from.

6
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Curiosity pulled him toward the forbidden forest.

7
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The trees whispered whenever the wind passed through them.

8
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Deep inside. he discovered a door standing alone.

9
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.000
No walls. No house. Just a door.

10
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.000
His hands trembled as he placed the key into the lock.

11
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Click.

12
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.000
The door opened onto a sky full of floating islands.

13
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Rivers flowed upward into the clouds.

14
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Gigantic creatures drifted silently across the horizon.

15
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Arin stepped through before fear could stop him.

16
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:04.000
The door vanished behind him.

17
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:08.000
For the first time. he felt truly lost.

18
00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:12.000
And for the first time. truly alive.

19
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:16.000
Far away. a mysterious light appeared.

20
00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:20.000
His adventure had only just begun.